UID:demo-2648-thu@lopanalys
DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T180000
DTEND:20261126T184130
SUMMARY:Hill repeats · 42 min
DESCRIPTION:Strength and stride: power in the push-off with little impact o
 n the legs.\n\nWarm-up: 15 min in Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slow
 er)\nIntervals: 8 × 45 s in Z5 (174–192 bpm · 4:10 min/km or faster)\,
  rest 90 s\nCool-down: 10 min in Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slowe
 r)\n\nAn even hill with a moderate slope. Strong uphill with a tall postur
 e and short steps\, an easy jog down as rest.
CATEGORIES:Training
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
