BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:demo-2649-thu@lopanalys
DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
DTSTART:20261203T180000
DTEND:20261203T185200
SUMMARY:Threshold intervals · 52 min
DESCRIPTION:Moves the threshold up: you can hold a higher pace for longer.\
 n\nWarm-up: 15 min in Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slower)\nInterva
 ls: 4 × 6 min in Z4 (170–174 bpm · 4:21–4:10 min/km)\, rest 1 min\nC
 ool-down: 10 min in Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slower)\n\nJust be
 low the threshold\, hard but controlled. You should be able to say a few w
 ords and manage one more interval when you finish. Jog or walk in the rest
 s.
CATEGORIES:Training
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
