DTEND:20261222T184800
SUMMARY:Hard intervals · 48 min
DESCRIPTION:Raises the maximal oxygen uptake\, the ceiling of your fitness.
 \n\nWarm-up: 15 min in Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slower)\nInterv
 als: 5 × 3 min in Z5 (174–192 bpm · 4:10 min/km or faster)\, rest 2 mi
 n\nCool-down: 10 min in Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slower)\n\nHar
 d and even: the same pace in the first and the last interval. The heart ra
 te reaches zone 5 only some way into the interval\, so go by pace and feel
  at first.
CATEGORIES:Training
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
