SUMMARY:Test at your coach · 1 h
DESCRIPTION:Shows what the training has given and sets new zones. Every com
 ing session gets new targets in heart rate and pace.\n\nWarm-up: 15 min in
  Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slower)\nTest: 35 min\nCool-down: 10 
 min in Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slower)\n\nCome rested: an easy
  day before\, no hard training for two days\, the same food and drink as b
 efore the last test.
CATEGORIES:Training
TRANSP:OPAQUE
