SUMMARY:Pre-race session · 30 min
DESCRIPTION:Keeps the speed awake without tiring you.\n\nWarm-up: 10 min in
  Z2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slower)\nIntervals: 4 × 1 min in Z4 
 (170–174 bpm · 4:21–4:10 min/km)\, rest 2 min\nCool-down: 10 min in Z
 2 (115–165 bpm · 4:33 min/km or slower)\n\nShort efforts at race feel w
 ith long rests. You should want to run more when you finish.
